   "text": "Take that, you bastard."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 83.44,
   "end": 85.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "This one's for Ichpe!"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 85.6,
   "end": 86.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Report!"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 86.22,
   "end": 88.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "Uh, I just.."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 88.12,
   "end": 91.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "I'm just checking... his vitals."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 91.02,
   "end": 92.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Is he going to make it?"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 92.4,
   "end": 95.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "Well, it's a good thing you got him to me when you did."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 95.28,
   "end": 98.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "Even a little later, and we might not have been able to save him."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 98.5,
   "end": 99.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Why isn't he naked?"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 99.84,
   "end": 100.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "Luckily, we--"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 101.64,
   "end": 102.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "...*what*?"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 102.46,
   "end": 105.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "In the healing tank; I always thought you needed to be nude."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 106.24,
   "end": 106.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "Wha--?"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 107.24,
   "end": 108.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "W-why would you think that?"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 108.92,
   "end": 113.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "You know, to... absorb all the healing juices."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 116.58,
   "end": 118.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "WELL, looks like you have everything under control here."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 119.92,
   "end": 121.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "Freaks me the f*ck out."
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 122.56,
   "end": 123.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "(Whistles)"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 123.56,
   "end": 124.2,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Tap, tap, tap"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 124.2,
   "end": 125.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "Is this thing on?"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 125.12,
   "end": 125.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "Is it o--"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 125.66,
   "end": 126.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "(Moaning)"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 126.9,
   "end": 128.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "OKAY, there we go."
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 128.46,
   "end": 129.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "(Clears his throat)"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 130.5,
   "end": 134.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "YOU are now thinking about what Zarbon did to you..."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 134.14,
   "end": 136.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "while you were unconscious."
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 136.82,
   "end": 139.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "Have fun with that... that... that..."
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 138.42,
   "end": 140.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "(Groaning)"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 140.82,
   "end": 147.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "You know, Vegeta, I've gotta admit - it was pretty impressive how you went all man-hunter on us."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 147.1,
   "end": 149.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "(Groaning intensifies)"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 147.1,
   "end": 149.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "But now, you're all ours."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 149.54,
   "end": 153.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "(Groaning intensifies further)"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 149.54,
   "end": 153.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "And I can't wait to watch Zarbon break you like a glowsti--"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 155.96,
   "end": 157.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Apool",
   "text": "Here I come, Ichpe..."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 160.4,
   "end": 162.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "And I want you here in twenty-four hours, understood?"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 163.04,
   "end": 165.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "And make sure to bring the up-to-date Scouters."
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 165.42,
   "end": 167.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ginyu",
   "text": "Understood, Lord Freeza."
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 167.2,
   "end": 170.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Lord Freeza, I really need to use the space Skype."
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 170.3,
   "end": 174.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Zarbon, what could possibly be so important that you need to interrupt me during my call?"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 174.92,
   "end": 177.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Well, I need to call my girlfriend."
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 177.06,
   "end": 177.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Well, I--"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 178.78,
   "end": 179.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "...Ginyu, I'll call you back."
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 181.98,
   "end": 182.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Come again?"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 183.08,
   "end": 189.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "You see, our one-year anniversary is coming up and I want to see where she wants to go so I can make reservations early."
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 189.88,
   "end": 190.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 190.98,
   "end": 192.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "And all this time I could have sworn you were--"
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 193.44,
   "end": 193.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "...Nevermind."
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 194.44,
   "end": 196.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "What, you thought I was single?"
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 196.24,
   "end": 197.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Well, no. I just..."
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 197.78,
   "end": 199.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I... thought you were into..."
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 200.18,
   "end": 202.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "You know, it really doesn't matter."
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 202.1,
   "end": 205.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Well, it matters to me; because, frankly, it sounds like you thought I was--"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 205.82,
   "end": 206.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Oran",
   "text": "LORD FREEZA!"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 206.74,
   "end": 208.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Oran",
   "text": "VEGETA'S BROKEN OUT OF THE HEALING T--"
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 208.24,
   "end": 209.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Oran",
   "text": "Aiee!"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 209.92,
   "end": 211.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh, no. That minion died."
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 211.16,
   "end": 212.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Could you go fix that?"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 212.08,
   "end": 213.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "We'll continue this conversation never."
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 214.96,
   "end": 216.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "...Did he say something about Vegeta?"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 216.76,
   "end": 217.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 217.42,
   "end": 218.46,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Explosion"
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 219.08,
   "end": 222.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Zarbon ... who did you leave guarding him?"
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 223.28,
   "end": 224.26,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Alarm"
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 223.28,
   "end": 224.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "APOOL?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 224.26,
   "end": 226.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "YOU LEFT APOOL HERE?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 226.32,
   "end": 227.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Well, I thought he could handle it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 227.8,
   "end": 231.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Apool couldn't handle a shot of raspberry Schnapps, much less Vegeta!"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 231.8,
   "end": 234.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh, where's the damn phone? I need to make another call."
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 234.6,
   "end": 236.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Yes, sir! I'll go look for Vegeta!"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 236.66,
   "end": 237.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "He won't get far!"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 241.88,
   "end": 245.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'Yes, that's right. Search all over for me, Zarbon.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 245.38,
   "end": 248.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'Of course, you'd never think to check inside your own SHIP!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 248.94,
   "end": 250.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'You know what they say:'"
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 250.7,
   "end": 254.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'\"Keep your friends close ... and your enemies closer.\"'"
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 254.92,
   "end": 258.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Huhaha! Hahaha! HA, hahahahahahahaha! Ha--"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 258.36,
   "end": 259.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Minion",
   "text": "Lord Freeza, I found him!"
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 259.8,
   "end": 260.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ah, f*ck it."
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 261.48,
   "end": 264.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Minion",
   "text": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 266.76,
   "end": 268.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Ginyu! Hurry up, double time!"
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 268.46,
   "end": 270.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Zarbon really screwed the pooch on this one."
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 270.96,
   "end": 273.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Lord Freeza, Vegeta's really giving us a pounding!"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 273.8,
   "end": 276.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I'm coming, Zarbon! Quick, grab my Balls!"
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 276.24,
   "end": 276.74,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Call ended"
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 277.88,
   "end": 279.58,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Snickering"
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 279.58,
   "end": 285.62,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Laughter"
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 285.62,
   "end": 288.28,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ A parody of \"I've Got A Lovely Bunch of Coconuts\" ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 292.42,
   "end": 295.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "♫ I've got a lovely bunch of Dragon Balls ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 295.1,
   "end": 296.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "♫ Do-do-do-do-do ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 296.0,
   "end": 298.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "♫ Here they are, all sitting in a bunch ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 298.16,
   "end": 299.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
